{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13110060","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13110060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1311006001:1":{"text":"見つけたわ。氷の元素が炎を持ち去ったのね。","source_cn":"找到了，原来是这些冰元素把亡灵之焰带走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB204F4C4D7A76611","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311006002:1":{"text":"ここが雪国だからでしょうか、こんなに強い氷の元素は見たことがありません！","source_cn":"这些冰元素比我之前见过的都强大，或许是因为白山足够寒冷...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC61B3879A7BCB4C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ここが雪国だからでしょうか、こんなに強い氷の元素は見たことがありません！","female":"ここが雪国だからでしょうか、こんなに強い氷の元素は見たことがありません！","variant_male_record_index":"143046","variant_female_record_index":"143047","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311006003:0":{"text":"ヴェリカさん、ここもカレリーナさんのお家の領地なんですか？","source_cn":"呃，瓦丽卡，这里也是卡列琳娜家的领地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x375F474BFED891F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311006004:1":{"text":"ええ、彼女の父親が気に入っていた狩猟場よ。確か、彼女の兄も時々研究用に生き物を狩りに来ていたそうよ。","source_cn":"嗯，是她家族的林地，她父亲最爱的小狩猎场，她哥哥偶尔也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB29CB2B213FA47EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1311006004":{"text":"ええ、彼女の父親が気に入っていた狩猟場よ。確か、彼女の兄も時々研究用に生き物を狩りに来ていたそうよ。","source_cn":"嗯，是她家族的林地，她父亲最爱的小狩猎场，她哥哥偶尔也会来这里狩猎一些生物用作研究。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB29CB2B213FA47EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311006005:1":{"text":"生前は博識な魔法学者だったそうよ。とても仲が良かったみたい。","source_cn":"她的哥哥生前似乎是个博学的魔法学者，兄妹感情很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF6A129AF422293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311006006:1":{"text":"生前って……","source_cn":"……生前？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7EBA97DA41A8F04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311006007:1":{"text":"彼もグレイヴボーンになったの……","source_cn":"现在的他也是个亡灵。亡灵……不算真正活着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2D23B57C8433B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311006009:1":{"text":"兄の方はかなりの人見知りでね、私も滅多に会えないの。","source_cn":"她的哥哥不喜欢见人，连我也很少见到他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x053865D4DAA87E96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311006010:1":{"text":"さあ、鍵も揃ったし、隠し扉を開けに行きましょう。","source_cn":"走吧，亡灵之焰已经找齐了，我们回去打开暗门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC36C9CA4617E015","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen